{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":8},"L'Homme debout","Pour décrocher un CDI dans l’entreprise de papier peint qui vient de l’engager, Clémence Alpharo, doit pousser Henri Giffard, VRP en fin de parcours, vers une retraite anticipée. Il faut rajeunir l’image de la petite boite. Mais Giffard refuse. Son travail semble être la seule chose qui donne encore un sens à sa vie. Coincée entre la perspective d’un avenir professionnel qui lui permettrait de fuir ses problèmes familiaux et l’affection inattendue qu’elle éprouve pour le VRP, Clémence va devoir choisir…",[4,5,6,7],"high rank employment","retirement","ageism","cross-gender friendship",{"type":9,"id":10,"slug":11,"title":12,"release":14,"filmType":18,"directors":19,"genre":27,"media":30,"synopsis":33,"production":34,"characters":37,"roles":53,"awards":81,"tags":3},"Film","FR2023_115","fr2023-115-l-homme-debout",{"native":1,"english":13},"",{"type":15,"date":16,"year":17},"Theatrical release","2023-05-17",2023,"Fiction film",[20],{"id":21,"slug":22,"name":21,"birthYear":23,"deathYear":23,"gender":24,"nationality":25,"awards":26},"Florence Vignon","florence-vignon",0,"Female identifying","France",[],[28,29],"Comedy","Drama",{"posterUrl":31,"trailerUrl":32},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/255/8/264447/format_page/l-homme-debout.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bUr25tzdfxo",{"native":2,"english":13},[35],{"country":25,"share":36},"Majority coproducer",[38],{"id":39,"film":10,"person":40,"age":46,"gender":44,"sexuality":47,"origin":48,"class":49,"profession":50,"ability":51,"assistedMobility":52},"FR2023_115_01",{"id":41,"slug":42,"name":41,"birthYear":43,"deathYear":23,"gender":44,"nationality":25,"awards":45},"Jacques Gamblin","jacques-gamblin",1957,"Male identifying",[],"3: Third Age (60-75)","Heterosexual","White Western European","Middle class","Employed","Able-bodied","No",[54,61,67,71,75],{"person":55,"role":60},{"id":56,"slug":57,"name":56,"birt